<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Cuauhtémoc</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">captured 1521</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Cuauhtémoc was the last ruler of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tenochtitlan">Tenochtitlan</a> and of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aztec-empire">Aztec Empire</a>. He led the defence of the city during the Spanish siege and was captured in 1521 when Tenochtitlan fell. He was later executed on the orders of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hernan-cortes">Hernán Cortés</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/cuauhtemoc.jpg" alt="Cuauhtémoc" width="262" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Luis Alvaz · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Relieve_de_Cuauht%C3%A9moc_(Jes%C3%BAs_F._Contreras)_09.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
